---
description: Linux LF line endings required
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is executed on Linux. Never write CRLF.

Windows Cursor/Serena/SSHFS edits caused CUSTOM/run_all.sh to fail with:
- set: pipefail: invalid option name
- CR command not found
- cd paths containing a trailing CR

.gitattributes eol=lf is not enough. After editing .sh, .csh, .tcl, .py, .v, or .sv from Windows, rewrite the file as raw LF bytes (Python read_bytes/write_bytes, not text mode). On the CAD host run sed -i 's/\r$//' FILE && file FILE before executing. A script is not done if Linux file reports CRLF.
